4,'pageComponents_6_introDescription','Empowering global enterprises with AI-driven engineering and senior-led delivery, built on trust, transparency, and long-term collaboration.'),(5638,34,'_pageComponents_6_introDescription','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introDescription'),(5639,34,'pageComponents_6_introButton_label','Explore Our Case Studies'),(5640,34,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_label','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_label'),(5641,34,'pageComponents_6_introButton_url','https://nsc.test/'),(5642,34,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_url','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_url'),(5643,34,'pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','0'),(5644,34,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_openInNewTab'),(5645,34,'pageComponents_6_introButton',''),(5646,34,'_pageComponents_6_introButton','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton'),(5647,34,'pageComponents_6_logos',''),(5648,34,'_pageComponents_6_logos','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_logos'),(5649,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','We worked with NSC to source a senior Go developer and couldn\'t be happier with the results. The developer\'s work has been excellent, and the NSC team provided outstanding support every step of the way.'),(5650,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(5651,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent',''),(5652,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(5653,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','Nicolas Carpi'),(5654,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(5655,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','CEO / Deltablot'),(5656,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(5657,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(5658,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(5659,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(5660,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(5661,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','Tony Motzfeldt'),(5662,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(5663,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(5664,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(5665,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(5666,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(5667,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent',''),(5668,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(5669,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','Marcus Tan'),(5670,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(5671,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(5672,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(5673,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(5674,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(5675,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(5676,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(5677,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','Alex'),(5678,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(5679,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','Solutions For Science'),(5680,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(5681,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(5682,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(5683,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent',''),(5684,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(5685,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','DongHee Shin'),(5686,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(5687,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorRole','PO / OGO Corp'),(5688,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(5689,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_content','We discovered NSC Software when we went searching for a more cost effective outsourcing business to develop our web application. They presented a great solution, which was completed within budget and fast! We now consider them an integral part of our development team, and have already re-engaged them on another project.'),(5690,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(5691,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_readMoreContent',''),(5692,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(5693,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_authorName','Laurence Smith'),(5694,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(5695,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_authorRole','CEO / Petlinx'),(5696,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(5697,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_content','We are very happy with the work that NSC did for us in developing our app for iOS and Android in Flutter. The collaboration was smooth and efficient, and the first version of the app was launched after just six months of collaboration. Won\'t hesitate to work with NSC again in another project!'),(5698,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(5699,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_readMoreContent',''),(5700,34,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(5701,34,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_authorName