pageComponents_6_introButton','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton'),(6313,35,'pageComponents_6_logos',''),(6314,35,'_pageComponents_6_logos','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_logos'),(6315,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','We worked with NSC to source a senior Go developer and couldn\'t be happier with the results. The developer\'s work has been excellent, and the NSC team provided outstanding support every step of the way.'),(6316,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(6317,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent',''),(6318,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(6319,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','Nicolas Carpi'),(6320,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(6321,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','CEO / Deltablot'),(6322,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(6323,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(6324,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(6325,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(6326,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(6327,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','Tony Motzfeldt'),(6328,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(6329,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(6330,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(6331,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(6332,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(6333,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent',''),(6334,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(6335,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','Marcus Tan'),(6336,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(6337,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(6338,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(6339,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(6340,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(6341,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(6342,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(6343,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','Alex'),(6344,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(6345,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','Solutions For Science'),(6346,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(6347,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(6348,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(6349,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent',''),(6350,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(6351,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','DongHee Shin'),(6352,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(6353,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorRole','PO / OGO Corp'),(6354,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(6355,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_content','We discovered NSC Software when we went searching for a more cost effective outsourcing business to develop our web application. They presented a great solution, which was completed within budget and fast! We now consider them an integral part of our development team, and have already re-engaged them on another project.'),(6356,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(6357,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_readMoreContent',''),(6358,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(6359,35,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_authorName','Laurence Smith'),(6360,35,'_pageComponents_6_testimoni