rtner'),(6968,36,'_pageComponents_6_title','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_title'),(6969,36,'pageComponents_6_introDescription','Empowering global enterprises with AI-driven engineering and senior-led delivery, built on trust, transparency, and long-term collaboration.'),(6970,36,'_pageComponents_6_introDescription','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introDescription'),(6971,36,'pageComponents_6_introButton_label','Explore Our Case Studies'),(6972,36,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_label','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_label'),(6973,36,'pageComponents_6_introButton_url','https://nsc.test/'),(6974,36,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_url','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_url'),(6975,36,'pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','0'),(6976,36,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_openInNewTab'),(6977,36,'pageComponents_6_introButton',''),(6978,36,'_pageComponents_6_introButton','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton'),(6979,36,'pageComponents_6_logos',''),(6980,36,'_pageComponents_6_logos','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_logos'),(6981,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','We worked with NSC to source a senior Go developer and couldn\'t be happier with the results. The developer\'s work has been excellent, and the NSC team provided outstanding support every step of the way.'),(6982,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(6983,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent',''),(6984,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(6985,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','Nicolas Carpi'),(6986,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(6987,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','CEO / Deltablot'),(6988,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(6989,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(6990,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(6991,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(6992,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(6993,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','Tony Motzfeldt'),(6994,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(6995,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(6996,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(6997,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(6998,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(6999,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent',''),(7000,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(7001,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','Marcus Tan'),(7002,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(7003,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(7004,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(7005,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(7006,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(7007,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(7008,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(7009,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','Alex'),(7010,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(7011,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','Solutions For Science'),(7012,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(7013,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(7014,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(7015,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent',''),(7016,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(7017,36,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','DongHee Shin'),(7018,36,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimon