monials_readMoreContent'),(10363,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','[test] Nicolas Carpi'),(10364,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(10365,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','[test] CEO / Deltablot'),(10366,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(10367,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','[test] We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(10368,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(10369,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','[test]\r\n\r\nWe can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(10370,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(10371,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','[test] Tony Motzfeldt'),(10372,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(10373,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','[test] CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(10374,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(10375,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','[test] Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(10376,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(10377,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','[test]'),(10378,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(10379,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','[test] Marcus Tan'),(10380,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(10381,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','[test] Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(10382,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(10383,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','[test] I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(10384,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(10385,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','[test]\r\n\r\nI worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(10386,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(10387,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','[test] Alex'),(10388,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(10389,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','[test] Solutions For Science'),(10390,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(10391,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','[test] NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(10392,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(10393,40,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','[test]'),(10394,40,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','