m provided outstanding support every step of the way.'),(11452,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(11453,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','[test]'),(11454,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(11455,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','39'),(11456,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(11457,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','[test] Nicolas Carpi'),(11458,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(11459,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','[test] CEO / Deltablot'),(11460,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(11461,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','[test] We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(11462,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(11463,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','[test]\r\n\r\nWe can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(11464,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(11465,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image',''),(11466,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(11467,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','[test] Tony Motzfeldt'),(11468,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(11469,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','[test] CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(11470,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(11471,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','[test] Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(11472,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(11473,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','[test]'),(11474,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(11475,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image',''),(11476,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(11477,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','[test] Marcus Tan'),(11478,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(11479,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','[test] Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(11480,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(11481,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','[test] I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(11482,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(11483,41,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','[test]\r\n\r\nI worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(11484,41,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlock