onials_1_readMoreContent','[test]\r\n\r\nWe can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(12836,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(12837,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image',''),(12838,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(12839,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','[test] Tony Motzfeldt'),(12840,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(12841,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','[test] CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(12842,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(12843,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','[test] Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(12844,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(12845,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','[test]'),(12846,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(12847,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image',''),(12848,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(12849,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','[test] Marcus Tan'),(12850,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(12851,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','[test] Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(12852,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(12853,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','[test] I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(12854,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(12855,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','[test]\r\n\r\nI worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(12856,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(12857,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image',''),(12858,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(12859,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','[test] Alex'),(12860,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(12861,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','[test] Solutions For Science'),(12862,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(12863,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','[test] NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(12864,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(12865,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','[test]'),(12866,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(12867,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image',''),(12868,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(12869,43,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','[test] DongHee Shin'),(12870,43,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','field_pageComp