nInNewTab'),(13503,44,'pageComponents_6_introButton',''),(13504,44,'_pageComponents_6_introButton','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton'),(13505,44,'pageComponents_6_logos',''),(13506,44,'_pageComponents_6_logos','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_logos'),(13507,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','[test] We worked with NSC to source a senior Go developer and couldn\'t be happier with the results. The developer\'s work has been excellent, and the NSC team provided outstanding support every step of the way.'),(13508,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(13509,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','[test]'),(13510,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(13511,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image',''),(13512,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(13513,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','[test] Nicolas Carpi'),(13514,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(13515,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','[test] CEO / Deltablot'),(13516,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(13517,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','[test] We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(13518,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(13519,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','[test]\r\n\r\nWe can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(13520,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(13521,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image',''),(13522,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(13523,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','[test] Tony Motzfeldt'),(13524,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(13525,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','[test] CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(13526,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(13527,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','[test] Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(13528,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(13529,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','[test]'),(13530,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(13531,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image',''),(13532,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(13533,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','[test] Marcus Tan'),(13534,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(13535,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','[test] Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(13536,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(13537,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','[test] I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(13538,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(13539,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','[test]\r\n\r\nI worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(13540,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(13541,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image',''),(13542,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(13543,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','[test] Alex'),(13544,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(13545,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','[test] Solutions For Science'),(13546,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(13547,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','[test] NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(13548,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(13549,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','[test]'),(13550,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(13551,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image',''),(13552,44,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(13553,44,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','[test] DongHee Shin'),(13554,