tton_openInNewTab','0'),(14188,45,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_openInNewTab'),(14189,45,'pageComponents_6_introButton',''),(14190,45,'_pageComponents_6_introButton','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton'),(14191,45,'pageComponents_6_logos',''),(14192,45,'_pageComponents_6_logos','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_logos'),(14193,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','[test] We worked with NSC to source a senior Go developer and couldn\'t be happier with the results. The developer\'s work has been excellent, and the NSC team provided outstanding support every step of the way.'),(14194,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(14195,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','[test]'),(14196,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(14197,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image',''),(14198,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(14199,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','[test] Nicolas Carpi'),(14200,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(14201,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','[test] CEO / Deltablot'),(14202,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(14203,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','[test] We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(14204,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(14205,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','[test]\r\n\r\nWe can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(14206,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(14207,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image',''),(14208,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(14209,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','[test] Tony Motzfeldt'),(14210,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimo