,'field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(14225,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','[test]\r\n\r\nI worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(14226,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(14227,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image',''),(14228,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(14229,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','[test] Alex'),(14230,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(14231,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','[test] Solutions For Science'),(14232,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(14233,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','[test] NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(14234,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(14235,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','[test]'),(14236,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(14237,45,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image',''),(14238,45,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image','field_pageC