ponents_6_introButton_url','https://nsc.test/'),(34376,239,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_url','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_url'),(34377,239,'pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','0'),(34378,239,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_openInNewTab'),(34379,239,'pageComponents_6_introButton',''),(34380,239,'_pageComponents_6_introButton','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton'),(34381,239,'pageComponents_6_logos',''),(34382,239,'_pageComponents_6_logos','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_logos'),(34383,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','We worked with NSC to source a senior Go developer and couldn\'t be happier with the results. The developer\'s work has been excellent, and the NSC team provided outstanding support every step of the way.'),(34384,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(34385,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent',''),(34386,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(34387,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image',''),(34388,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(34389,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','Nicolas Carpi'),(34390,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(34391,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','CEO / Deltablot'),(34392,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(34393,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(34394,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(34395,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(34396,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(34397,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image',''),(34398,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(34399,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','Tony Motzfeldt'),(34400,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(34401,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(34402,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(34403,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(34404,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(34405,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent',''),(34406,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(34407,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image',''),(34408,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(34409,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','Marcus Tan'),(34410,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(34411,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(34412,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(34413,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(34414,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(34415,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(34416,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(34417,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image',''),(34418,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(34419,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','Alex'),(34420,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(34421,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','Solutions For Science'),(34422,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(34423,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(34424,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(34425,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent',''),(34426,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'