_6_content','We are very happy with the work that NSC did for us in developing our app for iOS and Android in Flutter. The collaboration was smooth and efficient, and the first version of the app was launched after just six months of collaboration. Won\'t hesitate to work with NSC again in another project!'),(34444,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(34445,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_readMoreContent',''),(34446,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(34447,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_image',''),(34448,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(34449,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_authorName','Daniel Feldt'),(34450,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(34451,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_authorRole','CEO / Great Scott'),(34452,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_6_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(34453,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_7_content','My only regret was we didn\'t get to meet and work with NSC sooner, their team could have saved our company from months of wasted energy and resources working with the wrong people.'),(34454,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_7_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(34455,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_7_readMoreContent',''),(34456,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_7_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(34457,239,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_7_image',''),(34458,239,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_7_image','field_pageComponents_page