MoreContent'),(43416,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image',''),(43417,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(43418,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','Nicolas Carpi'),(43419,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(43420,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','CEO / Deltablot'),(43421,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(43422,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(43423,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(43424,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(43425,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(43426,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image',''),(43427,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(43428,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','Tony Motzfeldt'),(43429,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(43430,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(43431,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(43432,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(43433,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(43434,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent',''),(43435,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(43436,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image',''),(43437,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(43438,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','Marcus Tan'),(43439,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(43440,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(43441,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(43442,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(43443,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(43444,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(43445,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(43446,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image',''),(43447,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(43448,418,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','Alex'),(43449,418,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(43450,418,'pageComponents_6_t