mponents_nscCaseStudyHero_intro'),(44312,421,'caseStudyComponents_0_customerLabel','Customer:'),(44313,421,'_caseStudyComponents_0_customerLabel','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyHero_customerLabel'),(44314,421,'caseStudyComponents_0_customerTagline','AI Driven Software Development'),(44315,421,'_caseStudyComponents_0_customerTagline','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyHero_customerTagline'),(44316,421,'caseStudyComponents_1_requirementHeading','Business Requirement:'),(44317,421,'_caseStudyComponents_1_requirementHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_requirementHeading'),(44318,421,'caseStudyComponents_1_requirementBody','<p>Onboarding new engineers took months because knowledge lived in chat threads and one-off scripts. The goal for Smart Energy Monitor was sustainable ownership inside the client’s team.</p>'),(44319,421,'_caseStudyComponents_1_requirementBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_requirementBody'),(44320,421,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','Result:'),(44321,421,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultHeading'),(44322,421,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','<p>NSC paired documentation with code, ran playbooks for Smart Energy Monitor operations, and transitioned to client-led ceremonies with a defined support window. Hiring velocity improved measurably.</p>'),(44323,421,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultBody'),(44324,421,'caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','The team shipped a complex integration on a tight timeline without sacrificing quality. We would work with NSC again.'),(44325,421,'_caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_quoteText'),(44326,421,'caseStudyComponents_2_citeName','Priya Shah'),(44327,421,'_ca