buse patterns were evolving faster than manual reviews for Digital Wallet Platform. The ask was to combine rules with ML-assisted scoring without blocking legitimate users.</p>'),(44577,427,'_caseStudyComponents_1_requirementBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_requirementBody'),(44578,427,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','Result:'),(44579,427,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultHeading'),(44580,427,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','<p>NSC delivered a layered detection stack for Digital Wallet Platform with explainable flags, human review queues, and continuous evaluation. False positives fell while catch rates stayed steady.</p>'),(44581,427,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultBody'),(44582,427,'caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','NSC’s team asked the right questions early, which saved us rework later in the program.'),(44583,427,'_caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_quoteText'),(44584,427,'caseStudyComponents_2_citeName','Hiro Tanaka'),(44585,427,'_caseStudyComponents_2_citeName','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_citeName'),(44586,427,'caseStudyComponents_2_citeRole','Program Lead / NamiTech'),(44587,427,'_caseStudyComponents_2_citeRole','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_citeRole'),(44608,427,'_caseStudyComponents_layout_meta','a:2:{s:8:\"disabled\";a:0:{}s:7:\"renamed\";a:0:{}}'),(44609,427,'caseStudyComponents','a:5:{i:0;s:16:\"nscCaseStudyHero\";i:1;s:23:\"nscCaseStudyInstruction\";i:2;s:17:\"nscCaseStudyQuote\";i:3;s:19:\"nscCaseStudyContact\";i:4;s:16:\"nscCaseStudyMain\";}'),(44610,427,'_caseStudyComponents','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents'),(44611,428,'caseStudyComponents_0_intro','<p>Transparent tracking system for supply chains using distributed ledger technology.</p>'),(44612,428,'_caseStudyComponents_0_intro','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyHero_intro'),(44613,428,'caseStudyComponents_0_customerLabel','Customer:'),(44614,428,'_caseStudyComponents_0_customerLabel','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyHero_customerLabel'),(44615,428,'caseStudyComponents_0_customerTagline','AI Driven Software Development'),(44616,428,'_caseStudyComponents_0_customerTagline','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyHero_customerTagline'),(44617,428,'caseStudyComponents_1_requirementHeading','Business Requirement:'),(44618,428,'_caseStudyComponents_1_requirementHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_requirementHeading'),(44619,428,'caseStudyComponents_1_requirementBody','<p>The client needed to pass SOC-style readiness reviews for Blockchain Supply Chain Tracker while keeping velocity. Evidence collection and access reviews could not be a last-minute scramble.</p>'),(44620,428,'_caseStudyComponents_1_requirementBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_requirementBody'),(44621,428,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','Result:'),(44622,428,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultHeading'),(44623,428,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','<p>We aligned controls to stories, automated evidence exports for Blockchain Supply Chain Tracker, and rehearsed access reviews quarterly. Auditors received clear narratives tied to actual changes.</p>'),(44624,428,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultBody'),(44625,428,'caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','We valued their transparency on risks and trade-offs—no surprises at go-live.'),(44626,428,'_caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseS