 engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(48763,499,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(48764,499,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(48765,499,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(48766,499,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image',''),(48767,499,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(48768,499,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','Alex'),(48769,499,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(48770,499,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','Solutions For Science'),(48771,499,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(48772,499,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(48773,499,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(48774,499,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent',''),(48775,499,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockT