nents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(49448,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','Nicolas Carpi'),(49449,500,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(49450,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','CEO / Deltablot'),(49451,500,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(49452,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(49453,500,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(49454,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.\r\n\r\nTheir proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.\r\n\r\nWe can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.\r\n\r\nTheir approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.\r\n\r\nWe can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner'),(49455,500,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(49456,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image',''),(49457,500,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(49458,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','Tony Motzfeldt'),(49459,500,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(49460,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(49461,500,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(49462,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(49463,500,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(49464,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent',''),(49465,500,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(49466,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image',''),(49467,500,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(49468,500,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','Marcus Tan'),(4