 NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.'),(50895,502,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(50896,502,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image',''),(50897,502,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(50898,502,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','Alex'),(50899,502,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(50900,502,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','Solutions For Science'),(50901,502,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(50902,502,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(50903,502,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(50904,502,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent',''),(50905,502,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(50906,502,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image',''),(50907,502,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(50908,502,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','DongHee Shin'),(50909,502,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_