 <br class=\"lg:hidden\"> <sb>Software Development</sb> <br> <sb>Powered by</sb> <br class=\"lg:hidden\"> <span class=\"highlight\">Senior Engineers</span></h1>'),(64061,512,'pageComponents_2_description','<div class=\"iso-logos\"></div><p>Vietnam\'s <b>Top 7%</b> senior engineers. <b>AI-enabled</b> delivery. <b>Enterprise-grade</b> software.</p>'),(64062,512,'pageComponents_2_primaryCta','a:3:{s:3:\"url\";s:1:\"#\";s:5:\"title\";s:24:\"Explore our capabilities\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";}'),(64063,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_0_number','200'),(64064,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_0_suffix','+'),(64065,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_0_label','Senior Experts'),(64066,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_0_sublabel','(100% Senior-Level)'),(64067,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_1_number','100'),(64068,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_1_suffix','%'),(64069,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_1_label','English-Proficient Team'),(64070,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_1_sublabel',''),(64071,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_2_number','100'),(64072,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_2_suffix','+'),(64073,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_2_label','Successful Projects'),(64074,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_2_sublabel',''),(64075,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_3_number','50'),(64076,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_3_suffix','+'),(64077,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_3_label','Global Clients'),(64078,512,'pageComponents_3_stats_3_sublabel',''),(64079,512,'pageComponents_3_stats','4'),(64080,512,'pageComponents_4_options_light','0'),(64081,512,'pageComponents_5_heading','Our Services'),(64082,512,'pageComponents_5_intro','<p>NSC Software delivers AI-driven, end-to-end technology solutions that help businesses build modern digital products, optimize operations, & accelerate growth with a senior, high-quality engineering team.</p>'),(64083,512,'pageComponents_5_cta','a:3:{s:3:\"url\";s:1:\"#\";s:5:\"title\";s:20:\"Explore our services\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";}'),(64084,512,'pageComponents_5_services_0_number','01'),(64085,512,'pageComponents_5_services_0_title','Software Development & Digital Solutions'),(64086,512,'pageComponents_5_services_0_description','<p>Delivering full-cycle software development services - from product ideation and MVP to enterprise-scale platforms.</p>'),(64087,512,'pageComponents_5_services_1_number','02'),(64088,512,'pageComponents_5_services_1_title','Technology Consulting & Architecture'),(64089,512,'pageComponents_5_services_1_description','<p>Strategic technology advisory and solution architecture design.</p>'),(64090,512,'pageComponents_5_services_2_number','03'),(64091,512,'pageComponents_5_services_2_title','Cloud & DevOps Services'),(64092,512,'pageComponents_5_services_2_description','<p>Cloud-native engineering, infrastructure automation, and DevSecOps practices.</p>'),(64093,512,'pageComponents_5_services','3'),(64094,512,'pageComponents_6_heading','Why NSC Software?'),(64095,512,'pageComponents_6_items_0_title','Senior-Led, AI-Driven Expertise'),(64096,512,'pageComponents_6_items_0_description','<p>Projects are guided by senior engineers and enhanced by AI for higher efficiency and quality.</p>'),(64097,512,'pageComponents_6_items_1_title','Time-Zone Aligned Collaboration'),(64098,512,'pageComponents_6_items_1_description','<p>Teams operate in overlapping hours with Europe, Australia and the US for real-time coordination.</p>'),(64099,512,'pageComponents_6_items_2_title','Vietnam\'s Top 7% IT Talents'),(64100,512,'pageComponents_6_items_2_description','<p>Top 7% Vietnamese engineers, rigorously selected for technical excellence.</p>'),(64101,512,'pageComponents_6_items_3_title','100% English-Proficient Team'),(64102,512,'pageComponents_6_items_3_description','<p>Seamless communication and collaboration with clients across global regions.</p>'),(64103,512,'pageComponents_6_items_4_title','100% Senior-Level Engineers'),(64104,512,'pageComponents_6_items_4_description','<p>All engineers are senior professionals with a minimum of 6 years of experience.</p>'),(64105,512,'p