tudyComponents_0_customerTagline','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyHero_customerTagline'),(125790,1055,'caseStudyComponents_1_requirementHeading','(de) Business Requirement:'),(125791,1055,'_caseStudyComponents_1_requirementHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_requirementHeading'),(125792,1055,'caseStudyComponents_1_requirementBody','(de) <p>Onboarding new engineers took months because knowledge lived in chat threads and one-off scripts. The goal for Smart Energy Monitor was sustainable ownership inside the client’s team.</p>'),(125793,1055,'_caseStudyComponents_1_requirementBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_requirementBody'),(125794,1055,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','(de) Result:'),(125795,1055,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultHeading'),(125796,1055,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','(de) <p>NSC paired documentation with code, ran playbooks for Smart Energy Monitor operations, and transitioned to client-led ceremonies with a defined support window. Hiring velocity improved measurably.</p>'),(125797,1055,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultBody'),(125798,1055,'caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','(de) The team shipped a complex integration on a tight timeline without sacrificing quality. We would work with NSC again.'),(125799,1055,'_caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_quoteText'),(125800,1055,'caseStudyComponents_2_citeName','(de) Priya Shah'),(125801,1055,'_caseStudyComponents_2_citeName','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_citeName'),(125802,1055,'caseStudyComponents_2_citeRole','(de) CTO / HelioPay'),(125803,1055,'_caseStudyComponents_2_citeRole','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCas