) <p>Transparent tracking system for supply chains using distributed ledger technology.</p>'),(126105,1062,'_caseStudyComponents_0_intro','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyHero_intro'),(126106,1062,'caseStudyComponents_0_customerLabel','(de) Customer:'),(126107,1062,'_caseStudyComponents_0_customerLabel','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyHero_customerLabel'),(126108,1062,'caseStudyComponents_0_customerLogo','489'),(126109,1062,'_caseStudyComponents_0_customerLogo','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyHero_customerLogo'),(126110,1062,'caseStudyComponents_0_customerTagline','(de) AI Driven Software Development'),(126111,1062,'_caseStudyComponents_0_customerTagline','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyHero_customerTagline'),(126112,1062,'caseStudyComponents_1_requirementHeading','(de) Business Requirement:'),(126113,1062,'_caseStudyComponents_1_requirementHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_requirementHeading'),(126114,1062,'caseStudyComponents_1_requirementBody','(de) <p>The client needed to pass SOC-style readiness reviews for Blockchain Supply Chain Tracker while keeping velocity. Evidence collection and access reviews could not be a last-minute scramble.</p>'),(126115,1062,'_caseStudyComponents_1_requirementBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_requirementBody'),(126116,1062,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','(de) Result:'),(126117,1062,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultHeading'),(126118,1062,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','(de) <p>We aligned controls to stories, automated evidence exports for Blockchain Supply Chain Tracker, and rehearsed access reviews quarterly. Auditors received clear narratives tied to actual changes.</p>'),(126119,1062,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','field_caseStudyComponent