'_caseStudyComponents_1_requirementBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_requirementBody'),(126162,1063,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','(de) Result:'),(126163,1063,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultHeading'),(126164,1063,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','(de) <p>NSC added automated accessibility checks in CI, fixed keyboard flows for AI-Powered Learning Platform, and established translation workflows. Launch readiness reviews passed with fewer late surprises.</p>'),(126165,1063,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultBody'),(126166,1063,'caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','(de) From discovery to production support, NSC felt like an extension of our internal org.'),(126167,1063,'_caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_quoteText'),(126168,1063,'caseStudyComponents_2_citeName','(de) Thomas Meyer'),(126169,1063,'_caseStudyComponents_2_citeName','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_citeName'),(126170,1063,'caseStudyComponents_2_citeRole','(de) Head of IT / RheinWorks'),(126171,1063,'_caseStudyComponents_2_citeRole','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_citeRole'),(126173,1063,'_caseStudyComponents_3_collaborationHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_collaborationHeading'),(126175,1063,'_caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_0_blockTitle','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_overviewBlocks_blockTitle'),(126177,1063,'_caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_0_blockLines','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_overviewBlocks_blockLines'),(126179,1063,'_caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_1_blockTitle','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_overviewBlocks_blo