','(ja) Result:'),(129019,1123,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultHeading'),(129020,1123,'caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','(ja) <p>NSC added automated accessibility checks in CI, fixed keyboard flows for AI-Powered Learning Platform, and established translation workflows. Launch readiness reviews passed with fewer late surprises.</p>'),(129021,1123,'_caseStudyComponents_1_resultBody','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyInstruction_resultBody'),(129022,1123,'caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','(ja) From discovery to production support, NSC felt like an extension of our internal org.'),(129023,1123,'_caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_quoteText'),(129024,1123,'caseStudyComponents_2_citeName','(ja) Thomas Meyer'),(129025,1123,'_caseStudyComponents_2_citeName','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_citeName'),(129026,1123,'caseStudyComponents_2_citeRole','(ja) Head of IT / RheinWorks'),(129027,1123,'_caseStudyComponents_2_citeRole','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_citeRole'),(129029,1123,'_caseStudyComponents_3_collaborationHeading','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_collaborationHeading'),(129031,1123,'_caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_0_blockTitle','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_overviewBlocks_blockTitle'),(129033,1123,'_caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_0_blockLines','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_overviewBlocks_blockLines'),(129035,1123,'_caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_1_blockTitle','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_overviewBlocks_blockTitle'),(129037,1123,'_caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_1_blockLines','field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_overviewBlocks_blockLines'),(129039,112