challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(247544,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(247545,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','<p>We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.</p><p>Their proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.</p><p>We can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.</p><p>Their approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.</p><p>We can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner</p>'),(247549,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(247550,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','0'),(247554,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(247555,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','Tony Motzfeldt'),(247559,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(247560,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(247564,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(247565,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(247569,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(247570,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent',''),(247574,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(247575,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','0'),(247579,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(247580,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','Marcus Tan'),(247584,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(247585,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(247589,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(247590,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(247594,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(247595,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','<p>I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.</p>'),(247599,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(247600,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','0'),(247604,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(247605,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','Alex'),(247609,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(247610,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','Solutions For Science'),(247614,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(247615,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(247619,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(247620,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent',''),(247624,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(247625,7,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image','0'),(247629,7,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image','field_pageCompone