omponents_5_description','(de) <p>NSC integrates AI across the entire delivery lifecycle to enhance productivity, consistency, and decision-making.</p><p>We combine leading AI frameworks with proprietary, privacy-controlled models to ensure secure, compliant, and efficient delivery for every client engagement.</p>'),(250638,506,'_pageComponents_5_description','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockAiDriven_description'),(250639,506,'pageComponents_5_button_label','(de) Learn How We Leverage AI'),(250640,506,'_pageComponents_5_button_label','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockAiDriven_button_label'),(250641,506,'pageComponents_5_button_url','https://nsc.test/'),(250642,506,'_pageComponents_5_button_url','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockAiDriven_button_url'),(250643,506,'pageComponents_5_button_openInNewTab','0'),(250644,506,'_pageComponents_5_button_openInNewTab','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockAiDriven_button_openInNewTab'),(250645,506,'pageComponents_5_button',''),(250646,506,'_pageComponents_5_button','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockAiDriven_button'),(250647,506,'pageComponents_5_options',''),(250648,506,'_pageComponents_5_options','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockAiDriven_options'),(250649,506,'pageComponents_6_title','(de) Beyond A Partner'),(250650,506,'_pageComponents_6_title','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_title'),(250651,506,'pageComponents_6_introDescription','(de) Empowering global enterprises with AI-driven engineering and senior-led delivery, built on trust, transparency, and long-term collaboration.'),(250652,506,'_pageComponents_6_introDescription','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introDescription'),(250653,506,'pageComponents_6_introButton_label','(de) Explore Our Case Studies'),(250654,506,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_label','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_label'),(250655,506,'pageComponents_6_introButton_url','https://nsc.test/'),(250656,506,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_url','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_url'),(250657,506,'pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','0'),(250658,506,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_openInNewTab'),(250659,506,'pageComponents_6_introButton',''),(250660,506,'_pageComponents_6_introButton','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton'),(250661,506,'pageComponents_6_logos',''),(250662,506,'_pageComponents_6_logos','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_logos'),(250663,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','(de) We worked with NSC to source a senior Go developer and couldn\'t be happier with the results. The developer\'s work has been excellent, and the NSC team provided outstanding support every step of the way.'),(250664,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(250665,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent',''),(250666,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(250667,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','0'),(250668,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(250669,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','(de) Nicolas Carpi'),(250670,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(250671,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','(de) CEO / Deltablot'),(250672,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(250673,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','(de) We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(250674,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(250675,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','(de) <p>We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.</p><p>Their proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.</p><p>We can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.</p><p>Their approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.</p><p>We can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner</p>'),(250676,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(250677,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','0'),(250678,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(250679,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','(de) Tony Motzfeldt'),(250680,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(250681,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','(de) CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(250682,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(250683,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','(de) Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(250684,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(250685,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent',''),(250686,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(250687,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','0'),(250688,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(250689,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','(de) Marcus Tan'),(250690,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(250691,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','(de) Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(250692,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(250693,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','(de) I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(250694,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(250695,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','(de) <p>I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.</p>'),(250696,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(250697,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','0'),(250698,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(250699,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','(de) Alex'),(250700,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(250701,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','(de) Solutions For Science'),(250702,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(250703,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','(de) NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(250704,506,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(250705,506,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent',''),(250706,506,'_pageComp