ng support every step of the way.'),(252048,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(252049,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent',''),(252050,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(252051,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','0'),(252052,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(252053,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','(vi) Nicolas Carpi'),(252054,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(252055,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','(vi) CEO / Deltablot'),(252056,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(252057,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','(vi) We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(252058,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(252059,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','(vi) <p>We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.</p><p>Their proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.</p><p>We can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.</p><p>Their approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.</p><p>We can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner</p>'),(252060,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(252061,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','0'),(252062,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(252063,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','(vi) Tony Motzfeldt'),(252064,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(252065,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','(vi) CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(252066,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(252067,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','(vi) Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(252068,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(252069,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent',''),(252070,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(252071,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','0'),(252072,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(252073,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','(vi) Marcus Tan'),(252074,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(252075,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','(vi) Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(252076,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(252077,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','(vi) I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one.'),(252078,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(252079,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','(vi) <p>I worked with NCS for over a year, and my experience with their engineering team was consistently excellent. Their engineers demonstrated top-tier technical expertise, strong professionalism, and the ability to contribute effectively from day one. They were also a genuine pleasure to collaborate with. I would confidently recommend their services to anyone seeking a highly capable and well-resourced team.</p>'),(252080,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(252081,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','0'),(252082,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(252083,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','(vi) Alex'),(252084,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(252085,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','(vi) Solutions For Science'),(252086,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_3_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(252087,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','(vi) NCS team is a team that understands 100% what customers want. It has put us on the optimal path to the results our company wants'),(252088,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(252089,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent',''),(252090,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(252091,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image','0'),(252092,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(252093,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','(vi) DongHee Shin'),(252094,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(252095,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorRole','(vi) PO / OGO Corp'),(252096,507,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_4_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(252097,507,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_5_content','(vi) We discovered NSC Software when we went searching for a more cost effective outsou