l','(ja) Explore Our Case Studies'),(253422,508,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_label','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_label'),(253423,508,'pageComponents_6_introButton_url','https://nsc.test/'),(253424,508,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_url','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_url'),(253425,508,'pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','0'),(253426,508,'_pageComponents_6_introButton_openInNewTab','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton_openInNewTab'),(253427,508,'pageComponents_6_introButton',''),(253428,508,'_pageComponents_6_introButton','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_introButton'),(253429,508,'pageComponents_6_logos',''),(253430,508,'_pageComponents_6_logos','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_logos'),(253431,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','(ja) We worked with NSC to source a senior Go developer and couldn\'t be happier with the results. The developer\'s work has been excellent, and the NSC team provided outstanding support every step of the way.'),(253432,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(253433,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent',''),(253434,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(253435,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','0'),(253436,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(253437,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','(ja) Nicolas Carpi'),(253438,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(253439,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','(ja) CEO / Deltablot'),(253440,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_0_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(253441,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','(ja) We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.'),(253442,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(253443,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','(ja) <p>We can highly recommend NSC. They have been exceptionally flexible, professional, and solution-oriented throughout our collaboration. As a startup, challenges often arise on short notice, but NSC has always responded with great understanding and a genuine willingness to help.</p><p>Their proactive approach and strong sense of service make them a reliable and valued partner that we gladly recommend to others.</p><p>We can wholeheartedly recommend NSC without hesitation. Throughout our collaboration, they have proven to be highly flexible, professional, and solution-oriented. As a startup, unexpected challenges often arise at short notice, but NSC has consistently handled every situation with impressive understanding and a strong commitment to finding solutions that worked for both sides.</p><p>Their approach is characterized by excellent service, open communication, and a genuine interest in creating value for their clients. We have always felt confident working with them, and it is clear that they take pride in delivering quality and flexibility – even when things move quickly.</p><p>We can therefore warmly recommend NSC to any company looking for a reliable, dedicated, and collaborative partner</p>'),(253444,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(253445,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','0'),(253446,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(253447,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','(ja) Tony Motzfeldt'),(253448,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(253449,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','(ja) CEO and Founder / SHFT'),(253450,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_1_authorRole','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorRole'),(253451,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','(ja) Working with the NSC team has been a great experience. Their developers are highly skilled, professional, and consistently deliver quality results on time. We truly appreciate their technical expertise and the level of support they provide, they\'ve been a reliable and capable partner throughout our collaboration.'),(253452,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_content','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_content'),(253453,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent',''),(253454,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_readMoreContent','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_readMoreContent'),(253455,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','0'),(253456,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_image','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_image'),(253457,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','(ja) Marcus Tan'),(253458,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorName','field_pageComponents_pageComponents_nscBlockTestimonials_testimonials_authorName'),(253459,508,'pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','(ja) Senior Business Analyst / Ascent Lawyers'),(253460,508,'_pageComponents_6_testimonials_2_authorRole','field_pageCompo